--- !u!114 &576640728
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 576640726}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'THE LONG WAY HOME

    Eight competitors. Every heat uses the same seeded
    mile-long minefield. Drive farther before a mine or explosive sheep launches
    your truck. After a blast, let every bounce, skid, roll and subsequent mine blast
    finish. The final FORWARD rest position counts, including any backward slide.
    Low linear/angular movement must remain supported for1.5s; an airborne apex is
    never settled. Every blast and final-rest flag remains for this match, with participant/heat
    identification. Distances display in feet.


    WIN TWO WAYS

    Farthest valid
    final rest earns a heat point; tied leaders each score. First to five wins. Multiple
    match leaders run a tiebreak. Cross the one-mile finish while still DRIVING to
    win the entire match immediately. Crossing after a blast cannot win instantly.
    The180s driving limit does not cut off an active tumble. A genuine90s post-blast
    simulation failure visibly locks its CURRENT position as a recovery outcome.
    Leaving the authored world is a failed attempt.


    CONTROLS

    Steer and
    accelerate; opposite throttle brakes then reverses. In flight, left/right nudges
    trajectory. Release forward/back once after launch to enable small range correction.
    A shared2.2s correction budget cannot hover or reverse flight. After first surface
    contact there is no aftertouch or propulsion; motion remains physical until rest.


    READ
    THE COURSE

    Subtle mine plates, sheep, ramps and winding clear gaps reward
    observation. Mines restore identically each heat. AI sees only nearby clues and
    remembers its own previous blast, with the same forces and controls. Up to four
    local humans; AI fills eight. Pause/reconnect preserves all flags, scores and
    bodies. Recorded highlight has angle/speed/rewind/skip; AI advances automatically.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
